From 0a7583276263c756df881d827e51d1e80f7cdd89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 1 Apr 2026 08:03:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add LSM6DSV16X IMU driver and NeutronRC H743 BT HV board
 support

Add a new AP_InertialSensor_LSM6DSV16X backend driver for the
ST LSM6DSV16X 6-axis IMU (gyro + accel). The init sequence and
register configuration are ported from the BetaFlight driver
(accgyro_spi_lsm6dsv16x.c) to match proven-working hardware
settings:

- High-accuracy ODR mode 1 with 8 kHz gyro / 1 kHz accel
- 2000 dps gyro full scale (70 mdps/LSB)
- 16 G accel full scale (0.488 mg/LSB)
- LPF1 + LPF2 digital filtering enabled
- Direct register reads (no FIFO) at 1600 Hz sample rate

Also add a complete hwdef for the NeutronRC H743 BT HV flight
controller (board ID 7130) which uses dual LSM6DSV16X IMUs on
SPI1/SPI4 and a DPS310 barometer on I2C1. Pin mapping is derived
from the BetaFlight NEUTRONRC_H743_BT_HV unified target config.

This resolves the "INS Error: driver initialise error" that occurs
because ArduPilot had no driver for the LSM6DSV16X sensor.

https://claude.ai/code/session_01UTz21gzacqdsdR98kvR72m
